# Archetype-emitted dev docs — kept in the source tree for reference but
# excluded from the build context so they don't bloat the BFF image.
# NOTE: README.md is intentionally NOT excluded because pyproject.toml
# declares `readme = "README.md"`; uv_build reads it during `uv sync`.
